{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Ingest - is work arriving, and is any of it being refused?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events accepted /s",
      "description": "events_ingested_total counts events that were DURABLY accepted - the row is committed before the 202 is written. A drop to zero here with publishers still publishing is an ingest outage, not a quiet day.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(events_ingested_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rejected /s",
      "description": "Ingest requests refused, by reason. Non-zero is not automatically wrong (a publisher sending malformed JSON shows up here) but a step change usually means a publisher deployed something.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(events_ingestion_failed_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ingest rate by outcome",
      "description": "Accepted against rejected-by-reason. `payload_too_large` and `rate_limited` are publisher-side; anything else is worth reading the logs for.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(events_ingested_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(events_ingestion_failed_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected: {{reason}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Payload offloads and fetches",
      "description": "Large payloads go to object storage instead of inline into PostgreSQL. A rising offload `error` is an ingest outage in the making (a failed offload is a 500, never a 202); `missing` on the fetch side means the object is gone and the delivery failed distinctly, `unavailable` means the bucket did not answer and the delivery was deferred without burning an attempt.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(payload_offloads_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "offload: {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(payload_fetches_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "fetch: {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Delivery - what happened to the events we accepted?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Delivery outcomes /s",
      "description": "Terminal states only, so this is the answer to 'did it get there'. `exhausted` means the retry budget ran out and the delivery will never be attempted again without a manual replay - it is the series to alert on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(deliveries_completed_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Outbound response classes /s",
      "description": "What customer endpoints answered with. `error` is a transport failure (no HTTP response at all): DNS, connect, TLS, timeout. A rising 4xx is usually a customer's auth or signature verification, not our problem to fix but ours to notice.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (class) (rate(egress_http_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Attempt latency (one outbound HTTP call)",
      "description": "How long a single attempt took, split by outcome. The p99 tracking EGRESS_TOTAL_TIMEOUT_MS means attempts are being cut off at the ceiling rather than answered.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_attempt_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_attempt_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_attempt_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "End-to-end delivery latency (acceptance to first success)",
      "description": "delivery_latency_seconds is the number a customer would recognise: from the 202 to the moment their endpoint first accepted it. It includes queueing and every retry, which is why it is the SLI and attempt latency is not.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(delivery_latency_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "First-attempt success ratio",
      "description": "succeeded / all terminal outcomes, over the dashboard window. This falling while the delivery rate holds is the shape of one large customer breaking, not of the platform breaking.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(deliveries_completed_total{outcome=\"succeeded\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(deliveries_completed_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "success ratio",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": null,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.98
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Retries scheduled /s",
      "description": "deliveries_retried_total. Retries are normal; retries growing while the success ratio holds means endpoints are getting slower, not fewer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(deliveries_retried_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "retries",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Deliveries created /s",
      "description": "Rows materialised by the router: one per matching subscription, each with its own retry chain. Compare with events accepted - the ratio is the fan-out.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(deliveries_created_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "created",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Attempts in flight",
      "description": "worker_active_count summed across worker pods. Pinned at replicas x DELIVERY_CONCURRENCY means the pool is saturated and queue depth below is about to grow.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(worker_active_count)",
          "legendFormat": "in flight",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": null,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Backlog - is work piling up faster than it drains?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Queue depth by state",
      "description": "REQUIRES the queue-depth collector to be running (metrics.NewQueueDepthCollector, wired into the scheduler); without it every series here is a flat, believable zero. `ready` is claimable right now and is the backlog signal - and the autoscaling signal the worker HPA comment asks for. `delayed` is waiting out a backoff. `in_flight` is leased and being worked. A `ready` line that only climbs, with attempt rates flat, is work that is not being delivered at all: deliveries against an endpoint whose circuit breaker never closes look exactly like this and produce no attempts, no responses and no latency samples to notice them by.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (state) (queue_depth)",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
